**Gaps in design.md I filled myself**
- **The fact-row look isn't defined anywhere.** design.md only mentions "data-row circles". I used a white circle with a thin grey border around each coloured icon, label on the left and value in bold on the right. The Detail page needs the same rows, so this should probably be written into design.md and turned into a shared component before it's built. I kept it inside the page because the prompt ruled out new shared components.
- **The pin is in the secondary green.** design.md reserves the dark green for buttons and active states, so the pin uses the lighter green, which design.md allows for icon accents.

